      "Fix": "Cut the meta-commentary on the blank Ledger entry and end instead on one small, unresolved external detail \u2014 something outside the emotional payoff (e.g., an unanswered ping from Kyle, or Renn quietly re-arming the feed she swore was local-only) that reminds the reader the city\u0027s machinery is still running indifferent to what just happened."
